<title>UK: Estonian ESTIB sets 30 million million FRN.</title>
<headline>Estonian ESTIB sets 30 million million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ESTONIAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT     30 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +100 BP   PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	ISS PRICE  99.63     FULL FEES   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
